    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are privileged to bring to market one of the most beautiful residential properties in the stunning location of Coast Road, Inverin, Co. Galway. \n\nLoughaunbeg East is a spectacular detached bungalow home offering an abundance of accommodation & turn-key condition throughout. \n\nConstructed in 2009, the gated entrance & stone walled frontage leads to a deceptively large home with approximately 256.sqm of living space & thoughtful design which is evident immediately upon entry. \n\nThe property comprises of five sizeable bedrooms, two consisting of their own en-suites, three further bathrooms & stunning open concept living area with adjacent service & storage spaces. \n\nThe design allows the home to avail of plentiful natural light with & overlooking the beautiful grounds encompassing the home. \n\nAdditionally, Loughaunbeg East offers a separate double garage with an upper mezzanine which is connected via a neat shelter. \n\nExternally, the home is positioned on approximately 0.69 acre boasting manicured lawns, mature greenery, patio area, off-street parking & stunning surroundings. \n\nIdeally situated just off the sought after Connemara Coast Road, the detached home is an idyllic setting with picturesque surroundings. Whilst offering a peaceful setting, the residence is well positioned for all amenities nearby, including primary & secondary schools, with proximity to Inverin & Spiddal, as well as direct & quick access to Galway City. \n\nNearby beaches & shoreline are within easy reach expected of the coastal locale. \n\nLoughaunbeg East is a perfect home ideal for a variety of purchasers & will prove to be an ideal family home allowing potential new owners to acquire turn-key condition, abundance of accommodation, spacious living area & an idyllic location. \n\nViewing is highly recommended & guaranteed not to disappoint.\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \n\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database.\n\nFor Further details please contact O'Donnellan & Joyce on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.\n\nFLOORPLANS: The floor plan including furniture, fixture measurements and dimensions are approximate and for illustrative purposes only. The Polycam App used gives no guarantee, warranty or representation as to the accuracy and layout. All enquiries must be directed to the agent.\n\nWhilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars.\n\nNo person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
